WEBVTT

00:10:56.735 --> 00:11:01.198
In fact, it's rampant consumerism,
greed, imperialism,

00:11:01.240 --> 00:11:04.493
often your way of seeing
the world and seeing us,

00:11:04.493 --> 00:11:06.161
that has hurt the planet.

00:11:06.495 --> 00:11:07.830
Stop doing what I did,

00:11:07.871 --> 00:11:12.876
stop thinking that the modern way
of building our future

00:11:12.918 --> 00:11:14.086
is the best.

00:11:15.754 --> 00:11:18.132
It probably is a problem too.

00:11:18.590 --> 00:11:23.762
Communities closest to the climate crisis

00:11:23.762 --> 00:11:27.808
are also communities
closest to some solutions.

00:11:28.684 --> 00:11:30.060
Learn from us.